{"id":"vod_md_4598","vodId":"4598","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"玉子市场","name_cn":"玉子市场","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230910-1/cd2854ccc9fd9bc03bda1283b4d65903.jpg"},"summary":"在一座远离大都会吵闹喧嚣的平凡小镇，不甚兴旺的兔子山商业街内，生活着一群可爱有趣的人。故事的女主角北白川玉子（洲崎绫 配音）是当地饼店“玉屋”的长女，她性格活泼随和，擅长制作饮食，与对门面饼店“大路屋”的儿子大路饼藏（田丸笃志 配音）是一对青梅竹马，不过两家的爸爸是典型的同行冤家，彼此一见面便战火不断。这一日，玉子在花店意外发现一只会说话的鸟（山崎巧 配音）。鸟自称来自南方，肩负着神秘使命。鸟的到来自然为玉子和周边人的生活增添不少乐趣，而快乐浪漫的青春校园生活又令人心驰神往。围绕着情人节、祭祀以及部团活动，兔子山商业街平凡而有趣的故事交替上演……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-10 07:57:25","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/VRZ7Sv2p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/LiK4LDv7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/YlKLdOl7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/3EoE8cYg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/WQ8MiInI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/CLLSbIgD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/cwZPcoJr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/TzTLUd4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/2E2N0ahQ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/NAKQPjgk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/kSTh0ETm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/80GhCaPn/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:31.753Z"}